| CSS Attribute Selector | Operator |        CSS Selector Syntax        |                  XPath Syntax                   |
| :--------------------: | :------: | :-------------------------------: | :---------------------------------------------: |
|        Contains        |   \*=    | tag[attribute *= 'partial-value'] |  //tag[contains(@attribute, 'partial-value')]   |
