### 2.4 First-of-type

The `first-of-type` selector allows us to select the first element of a specified type among a group of sibling elements. 

The _type_ refers to the element tag like `<div>`, `<p>`, `<a>`, etc. 


#### Syntax

```text
:first-of-type
```

