## 3. XPath vs CSS Selectors


Below are the main differences between XPath and CSS Selectors

| XPath                                                                                                                      | CSS Selectors                                                                                            |
| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| XPath allows bidirectional flow while identifying the element                                                              | In CSS Selectors, the flow of finding the elements is always a one way direction not a two way direction |
| XPath allows identification of elements with the help of visible text appearing on screen with the help of text() function | CSS Selectors does not have the feature to locate elements based on the visible text                     |
</Section>

