## 1. TestNG

TestNG is a powerful testing framework that offers advanced functionalities such as parallel test execution, test configuration, and comprehensive reporting.

It is an open-source automated testing framework; where NG of TestNG means Next Generation.

It is inspired by JUnit and NUnit, along with some new functionality that makes it more powerful and easier to use.

**Advantages**

- Parallel Test Execution
- Annotations
- Grouping and prioritizing Tests
- Generating reports of execution
- Data Parameterization

