- The `@BeforeMethod` annotation is used to annotate a method that should be executed before each test method within a test class.
- The `@AfterMethod` annotation is used to annotate a method that should be executed after each test method within a test class.
- In TestNG, the `@DataProvider` annotation is used to specify a method that will provide data for a test method. 
