#### Additional Options

- *Glue:* Specifies the package where step definitions are located
    - If we haven't provided the glue option in our TestRunner file, Cucumber will use the package of the TestRunner class as the default package to look for step definitions.
    - It will search for step definitions in the same package as the TestRunner class(here, it is a Java package) and in any sub-packages.
- *Plugin:* Defines the output format and plugins to be used, such as JSON, HTML, or JUnit reports
- *Tags:* Allows filtering of scenarios based on tags so that we can run specific subsets of our tests

