## Introduction

In automated web testing, it is essential to simulate various user interactions to ensure that a website or web application functions correctly. 

Selenium WebDriver provides a comprehensive set of methods to perform a wide range of user actions on web elements.

These actions, including hovering over elements, scrolling the page, capturing screenshots, and performing drag-and-drop operations, are crucial for testing dynamic web pages, user interfaces, and interactive features.

